{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"sql-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"SQL Snippets","description":"Queries, joins, windows, indexes and migrations for the built-in SQL language.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"SQL","path":"snippets/sql.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/sql.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Select\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sel\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"SELECT ${1:*}\",\n      \"FROM ${2:table}\",\n      \"WHERE ${3:condition};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"SELECT\"\n  },\n  \"Insert\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ins\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"INSERT INTO ${1:table} (${2:columns}) VALUES (${3:values});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"INSERT\"\n  },\n  \"Update\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"upd\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"UPDATE ${1:table}\",\n      \"SET ${2:column} = ${3:value}\",\n      \"WHERE ${4:condition};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"UPDATE\"\n  },\n  \"Delete\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"del\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"DELETE FROM ${1:table}\",\n      \"WHERE ${2:condition};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"DELETE\"\n  },\n  \"Create table\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"CREATE TABLE ${1:name} (\",\n      \"\\tid INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,\",\n      \"\\t${2:column} ${3:TEXT} NOT NULL\",\n      \");\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CREATE TABLE\"\n  },\n  \"Left join\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lj\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"LEFT JOIN ${1:other} ON ${1:other}.${2:id} = ${3:table}.${4:other_id}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"LEFT JOIN\"\n  },\n  \"Group by\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"SELECT ${1:column}, COUNT(*) AS n\",\n      \"FROM ${2:table}\",\n      \"GROUP BY ${1:column}\",\n      \"ORDER BY n DESC;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"GROUP BY with count\"\n  },\n  \"Window function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"win\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY ${1:column} ORDER BY ${2:other} DESC)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"ROW_NUMBER over a partition\"\n  },\n  \"Index\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"idx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"CREATE INDEX ${1:idx_name} ON ${2:table} (${3:column});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CREATE INDEX\"\n  },\n  \"Transaction\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"BEGIN;\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"COMMIT;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A transaction\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# SQL Snippets\n\nQueries, joins, windows, indexes and migrations for the built-in SQL language.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 10 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| SQL | `sel` | SELECT |\n| SQL | `ins` | INSERT |\n| SQL | `upd` | UPDATE |\n| SQL | `del` | DELETE |\n| SQL | `ct` | CREATE TABLE |\n| SQL | `lj` | LEFT JOIN |\n| SQL | `gb` | GROUP BY with count |\n| SQL | `win` | ROW_NUMBER over a partition |\n| SQL | `idx` | CREATE INDEX |\n| SQL | `tx` | A transaction |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}